    "text": "Which of the following best describes the diagram of molecular orbital?\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/mvtXkZ6kZPjy49KKhDKhiP86mp3Q2mKs62btivEvdtI.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
